und anh\u00f6ren, wie gut Du dich geschlagen hast.\n\nDie aktuellen R\u00e4ume sind:\n- Konferenzraum mit 3 Personen (Bewerbungsgespr\u00e4ch)\n- Seminarraum"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImpLandscape.png", "id": "2476178992540280", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65398055_2476178995873613_5890563130306836643_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U4iHWeVwwzUQ7kNvwGAdabE&_nc_oc=Adn74fw_nEdvfvQXUuSJ9c7C_-qE-ZAKBEPIn-ndPyj9Jt1DQKoubIUjPZ5czgjr3u4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx1IW1U1K3x_t_cxSo7yY4NXIT9OPP7rdp6aXt8ZdZA9A&oe=69B948C7"}, {"file_name": "ImpCover.png", "id": "2401543720011882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575350_2401543723345215_1378399666035813534_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3fFdk3lIdxoQ7kNvwEd9WWU&_nc_oc=AdntRM4yaAInZ_aLWMUYVx1Hekjo5HcTA1AOgRN6EJTem0WXBD4RxvoP3vVjrr7ra4w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz2SxKGngffmH_d9F1MNOLtPEMkhkLbm_fkDq8D6u97Xg&oe=69B9567C"}, {"file_name": "ImpHero.png", "id": "1575384222929044", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974551_1575384226262377_3077729185527084450_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O-iRi8GU5rQQ7kNvwERiZCJ&_nc_oc=AdkqFXDDIfQS3ES5dVUpWxsL6TI2qvhgrSW7JhdqHjgiLBdABqdmRwQU8H4ezUaGsf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxFRWLTwhD9JiTZ1e2B2tArLjjGmKNO9_mUACnVNQUSvw&oe=69B947AB"}, {"file_name": "Basic ohne Claim (3).png", "id": "1408933533196382", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974709_1408933536529715_4465469510707743650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RGydbHxjoRkQ7kNvwFD3A1F&_nc_oc=Adk4kSjPZUKoWG1P0D056AnzDdITqD90TDEaa4tbcwKZGpfz5KtytQ2IHBTqQrEfnjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculusc